@startuml delivery_budget
!theme cyborg
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
title How many delivery attempts fit into 10 s after Stop? (P13, provisional until TICKET-213)
concise "Four full nominal attempts\n(needs 22 s)" as Full
concise "Example A: each step\nuses its full limit" as Timeouts
concise "Example B: every attempt\nfails after 0.5 s" as Fast
scale 1 as 85 pixels
@0
Full is "setup 3 s"
Timeouts is "setup 3 s"
Fast is "A1"
@0.5
Fast is "gap 2 s"
@2.5
Fast is "A2"
@3
Full is "receipt 1 s"
Timeouts is "receipt 1 s"
Fast is "gap 2 s"
@4
Full is "gap 2 s"
Timeouts is "gap 2 s"
@5
Fast is "A3"
@5.5
Fast is "gap 2 s"
@6
Full is "setup 3 s"
Timeouts is "setup truncated"
@7.5
Fast is "A4"
@8
Fast is {-}
@9
Full is "receipt 1 s"
Timeouts is "cleanup reserve"
@10
Full is "gap 2 s"
Timeouts is {-}
@12
Full is "setup 3 s"
@15
Full is "receipt 1 s"
@16
Full is "gap 2 s"
@18
Full is "setup 3 s"
@21
Full is "receipt 1 s"
@22
Full is {-}
highlight 9 to 10 #4a3a14
highlight 10 to 22 #3a1620
Timeouts@0 <-> @10 : deadline = Stop + 10 s
note bottom of Timeouts
 Yellow: 1 s cleanup reserve; red: past the deadline.
 "receipt 1 s" = write request and receive receipt.
 Attempts end 1 s before the deadline: setup and write+receipt
 limits are truncated by the remaining budget. A second attempt
 starts at 6 s and its setup is cut at 9 s: one full attempt
 plus one truncated attempt fit.
end note
note bottom of Fast
 A gap starts only after the failed attempt has quiesced and only
 if more than 2 s of budget remain. Short failures let all 4
 attempts fit (8 s). A reused connection skips the setup.
end note
@enduml
